---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
---

<PolicyPage
  title="Returns Policy"
  heading="Returns Policy"
  description="Kins Trendy Collections returns policy: what to do if your item arrives faulty or is not what you ordered."
>
  <p>
    We want you to be happy with your order. If something is wrong, tell us and we will sort it out.
  </p>

  <h2>What we accept returns for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>An item that arrives faulty or damaged.</li>
    <li>An item that is not what you ordered. This includes a different size from the one you asked us for.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>In these cases we will arrange a replacement or a refund with you.</p>

  <h2>What we do not accept returns for</h2>
  <p>
    We do not accept returns for a change of mind. For shoes, please check your size before you
    order and send it to us, so we can confirm it is available.
  </p>

  <h2>How to tell us</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Contact us on WhatsApp or by phone as soon as you receive your order.</li>
    <li>Tell us the item name and send a clear photo showing the problem.</li>
    <li>We will reply and agree the next step with you.</li>
  </ol>

  <p>Delivery details are on our <a href="/delivery">Delivery Areas &amp; Times</a> page.</p>
</PolicyPage>
